sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant O as Research Orchestrator
    participant Q as Message Queue
    participant CS as Company Info Service
    participant WS as Web Scraper Service
    participant SS as Social Media Service
    participant NS as News Service
    participant IS as Industry Service
    participant V as Validation Service
    participant A as Analytics Engine
    participant R as Report Generator
    participant RDB as Raw Data Store
    participant PDB as Processed Data Store
    participant RS as Report Store

    Note over C,RS: Research Request Flow

    C->>G: POST /research/companies<br/>{"companies": ["Company A", "Company B"]}
    G->>G: Authenticate & Rate Limit
    G->>O: Forward research request
    O->>O: Create workflow & task breakdown
    O->>C: Return job_id: "12345"

    Note over O,IS: Parallel Data Collection Phase

    par Company Info Collection
        O->>Q: Publish task: collect_company_info
        Q->>CS: Process company info task
        CS->>CS: Call Google Places API
        CS->>RDB: Store raw company data
        CS->>Q: Publish: company_info_complete
    and Web Scraping
        O->>Q: Publish task: scrape_websites
        Q->>WS: Process website scraping task
        WS->>WS: Scrape company websites
        WS->>RDB: Store raw web data
        WS->>Q: Publish: web_scraping_complete
    and Social Media Collection
        O->>Q: Publish task: collect_social_data
        Q->>SS: Process social media task
        SS->>SS: Scrape LinkedIn, Twitter, etc.
        SS->>RDB: Store raw social data
        SS->>Q: Publish: social_data_complete
    and News Collection
        O->>Q: Publish task: collect_news
        Q->>NS: Process news collection task
        NS->>NS: Fetch recent news & events
        NS->>RDB: Store raw news data
        NS->>Q: Publish: news_collection_complete
    and Industry Data Collection
        O->>Q: Publish task: collect_industry_data
        Q->>IS: Process industry data task
        IS->>IS: Query business directories
        IS->>RDB: Store raw industry data
        IS->>Q: Publish: industry_data_complete
    end

    Note over V,A: Data Processing Phase

    Q->>V: All collection complete - start validation
    V->>RDB: Retrieve all raw data
    V->>V: Cross-validate & resolve conflicts
    V->>PDB: Store validated data
    V->>Q: Publish: validation_complete

    Q->>A: Start analytics processing
    A->>PDB: Retrieve validated data
    A->>A: Generate SWOT, insights, analysis
    A->>PDB: Store analytics results
    A->>Q: Publish: analytics_complete

    Note over R,C: Report Generation & Delivery

    Q->>R: Start report generation
    R->>PDB: Retrieve all processed data
    R->>R: Generate configurable report
    R->>RS: Store final report
    R->>Q: Publish: report_complete
    Q->>O: Notify workflow complete
    O->>C: Send completion notification

    Note over C,RS: Report Retrieval

    C->>G: GET /reports/12345
    G->>RS: Fetch report
    RS->>G: Return report data
    G->>C: Return Market Intelligence report

    Note over C,RS: Error Handling & Retries

    alt Data Collection Failure
        CS-->>Q: Publish: collection_failed
        Q-->>O: Notify failure
        O-->>O: Trigger retry with backoff
        O-->>Q: Re-publish task
    end

    alt Rate Limit Hit
        SS-->>SS: Detect rate limit
        SS-->>Q: Publish: rate_limit_delay
        Q-->>O: Schedule delayed retry
    end